- Added `null | "files" | "terminal"` Session state.
- Added mobile Files, Terminal, Close controls.
- Added WorkspaceInspector `view` prop.
- Prevented terminal connection in Files mode.
- Preserved desktop combined behavior.
- No e2e added. Manual iPhone validation remains.

Red tests confirmed before fixes. Focused tests, typecheck, build pass.

